Add integration tests using two OAuth subjects with colliding server/view/tool names and multiple clients per user. Cover every listing/call/admin/cache/resource path, missing/unknown identity, mixed bearer identity on reused sessions, default/search endpoints, concurrent access, and static/stdio policy. Acceptance: user configuration is selected from OAuth everywhere; no global fallback or connection reuse crosses users; tests fail under intentionally unscoped lookup. Deliberately broaden login allowlist and verify a second valid subject still cannot discover, call, administer or retrieve any owner data; test login succeeds but ownership denial holds, plus no first-login data capture.
